ighest mountain on Earth, a symbol of extreme mountaineering, and a culturally sacred peak.</a></li><li data-id="what-mountain-range-is-mount-everest-in-is-it-a-part-of-the-himalayas"><li data-id="what-mountain-range-is-mount-everest-in-is-it-a-part-of-the-himalayas"><a href="#what-mountain-range-is-mount-everest-in-is-it-a-part-of-the-himalayas"><span class="number">9</span> What mountain range is Mount everest in? Is it a part of the Himalayas?</a></li><li data-id="is-mount-everest-8848-or-8849"><li data-id="is-mount-everest-8848-or-8849"><a href="#is-mount-everest-8848-or-8849"><span class="number">10</span> Is Mount Everest 8848 or 8849?</a></li><li data-id="historical-and-cultural-significance-everest-chomolungma"><li data-id="historical-and-cultural-significance-everest-chomolungma"><a href="#historical-and-cultural-significance-everest-chomolungma"><span class="number">11</span> Historical and Cultural Significance: Everest Chomolungma​</a></li><li data-id="berg-everest-where-exactly-is-mount-everest-located-what-country-is-everest-in"><li data-id="berg-everest-where-exactly-is-mount-everest-located-what-country-is-everest-in"><a href="#berg-everest-where-exactly-is-mount-everest-located-what-country-is-everest-in"><span class="number">12</span> Berg Everest: Where exactly is Mount Everest located? What country is Everest in?</a></li><li data-id="geological-and-physical-features-of-berg-everest"><li data-id="geological-and-physical-features-of-berg-everest"><a href="#geological-and-physical-features-of-berg-everest"><span class="number">13</span> Geological and Physical Features of Berg Everest</a></li><li data-id="geological-composition"><li data-id="geological-composition"><a href="#geological-composition"><span class="number">14</span> Geological Composition</a></li><li data-id="where-is-mount-everest-in-asia-nepal-or-tibet"><li data-id="mount-everest-is-located-on-the-border-between-nepal-and-the-tibet-autonomous-region-of-china-in-the-mahalangur-himal-su