erest Climbing Permit Fees by 36%- New Permit Cost</a></li></ol></li><li data-id="climbing-history-and-routes-of-mount-everest"><li data-id="climbing-history-and-routes-of-mount-everest"><a href="#climbing-history-and-routes-of-mount-everest"><span class="number">20</span> Climbing History and Routes of Mount Everest</a></li><li data-id="how-tall-is-mount-everest-how-two-reached-the-height-of-mount-everest"><li data-id="how-tall-is-mount-everest-how-two-reached-the-height-of-mount-everest"><a href="#how-tall-is-mount-everest-how-two-reached-the-height-of-mount-everest"><span class="number">21</span> How tall is Mount Everest? How two reached the height of Mount Everest?</a></li><li data-id="north-col-route-tibet-or-north-face-of-mount-everest"><li data-id="climbing-routes-of-mount-everest"><a href="#climbing-routes-of-mount-everest"><span class="number">22</span> Climbing Routes of Mount Everest:</a><ol><li data-id="south-col-route-nepal-or-the-south-face-of-mount-everest"><a href="#south-col-route-nepal-or-the-south-face-of-mount-everest"><span class="number">22.1</span> South Col Route (Nepal) or the South Face of Mount Everest:</a></li><li data-id="base-camp-of-highest-mountain-in-the-world-mount-everest"><a href="#base-camp-of-highest-mountain-in-the-world-mount-everest"><span class="number">22.2</span> Base Camp of highest Mountain in the world: Mount Everest</a></li><li data-id="north-col-route-tibet-or-north-face-of-mount-everest"><a href="#north-col-route-tibet-or-north-face-of-mount-everest"><span class="number">22.3</span> North Col Route (Tibet) or North Face of Mount Everest:</a></li></ol></li><li data-id="highest-and-tallest-mountain-in-the-world-where-do-we-find-mt-everest"><li data-id="challenges-of-climbing-mount-everest"><a href="#challenges-of-climbing-mount-everest"><span class="number">23</span> Challenges of Climbing Mount Everest:</a><ol><li data-id="highest-and-tallest-mountain-in-the-world-where-do-we-find-mt-everest"><a href="#highest-and-ta